, common URLs are:\\nLM Stu...","status":"ok","task_id":"20260626_051954_01777b","tool_call_id":"call_115227b8cf334f069c603ce8","tool_name":"browser_console","turn_id":"20260626_051954_01777b:20260626_051954_01777b:d559b02d"},"sessionId":"20260626_051954_01777b","timestamp":"2026-06-26T13:30:45.091788+00:00"},"type":"raw"}}␀��␀�J��